# Catalan (ca_ES) draft for School Connect's app-only strings (central Catalan, Softcatalà style:
# buttons in the imperative, "Afegeix", "Desa"; messages addressing the reader as vós, "Trieu").
# Vocabulary (Catalan school terms): grup classe (form group, e.g. 1r ESO A; Gibbon has
# Agrupacions), nivell (year group; Gibbon has "Grup d'Any"), classe (class, a teaching group),
# matèria (course; Gibbon's Curs clashes with the school year, "curs escolar"), sessió/lliçó
# (lesson/period), curs escolar (school year), trimestre (term; Gibbon has Terme, "a word"),
# deures (homework), horari (timetable), planificador (planner), quadern de notes (markbook),
# notes (grades), personal (staff; Gibbon has Penta, a musical staff), alumne (student; Gibbon's
# estudiant suits a university), responsable (parent, as Gibbon has), adult, aula (facility),
# àrea d'aprenentatge, departament, matrícula (enrolment), assistència (attendance), tutor/a,
# butlletí de notes (report card), comportament.

